   157	    // Every other structured failure mode on this page degrades in place
   158	    // (missing type → amber notice, subject mismatch → gray notice, thrown
   159	    // validate/buildRequests → question-scoped error). A render throw was
   160	    // the one that didn't: it unwound to the router's page boundary and
   161	    // replaced the whole fill session — every other form, every answer
   162	    // already typed — with the generic error screen. Contain it here, in
   163	    // the same dashed notice the other degradations use.
