## Ground truth

Tree state: branch `bodhi/questionnaire-fill`, HEAD `a82110da0f2049a83371331921ea0f069e6d2dbe`. Every line number below was read from the working tree at that commit. File lengths for the seven named seams (use as a sanity check before editing):

